WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.566
Carabas checked his tomatoes.

2
00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:11.391
He heard a squawk and wings flapping.

3
00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:16.353
He turned around.

4
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:21.069
Several birds flew off from his berry bushes.

5
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:27.028
They carried berries in their beaks.

6
00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:29.758
Carabas shook his fist.

7
00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:42.844
"Thieves!" he shouted.

8
00:00:42.845 --> 00:00:46.930
Carabas walked back and forth.

9
00:00:46.931 --> 00:00:51.452
"Birds are eating my berries," he thought.

10
00:00:51.453 --> 00:00:55.178
"How will I stop them?"

11
00:00:55.179 --> 00:00:59.116
Suddenly Carabas stopped.

12
00:00:59.117 --> 00:01:02.990
"Puss gave me a gold coin," he thought.

13
00:01:02.991 --> 00:01:06.889
"I'll use it for food—and some nets.

14
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.224
Then I can cover the berry bushes."

15
00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:18.013
Later Puss found Carabas in the garden.

16
00:01:18.014 --> 00:01:22.641
Carabas was placing nets over the berry bushes.

17
00:01:22.642 --> 00:01:26.449
"Hello, Master!" Puss said.

18
00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.637
Carabas patted the cat.

19
00:01:29.638 --> 00:01:32.268
"Master," Puss said.

20
00:01:32.269 --> 00:01:35.934
"I have a plan to change your life.

21
00:01:35.935 --> 00:01:39.442
You're getting married!"

22
00:01:39.443 --> 00:01:43.352
Carabas shook his head and laughed.

23
00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:47.623
"Puss, that's a silly idea."

24
00:01:47.624 --> 00:01:52.653
Puss told Carabas all about Fiona.

25
00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:56.932
He didn't say she was a princess.

26
00:01:56.933 --> 00:01:59.724
"Gosh," Carabas said.

27
00:01:59.725 --> 00:02:02.015
"Fiona sounds nice.

28
00:02:02.016 --> 00:02:04.648
When can I meet her?"

29
00:02:04.649 --> 00:02:08.352
Puss looked at Carabas carefully.

30
00:02:08.353 --> 00:02:12.032
Carabas' pants and shirt had holes.

31
00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:17.899
His shoes were still falling apart.

32
00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.480
"First we must go shopping," Puss said.

33
00:02:21.481 --> 00:02:24.552
"Where is the gold coin from the king?"

34
00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:29.470
Carabas bit his lip. "I'm sorry, Puss.

35
00:02:29.471 --> 00:02:32.697
I spent it on food and these nets.

36
00:02:32.698 --> 00:02:39.508
I ruined your plan!"

